## Constraints

- This preview uses local mock data only and is a 100% static frontend page.
- This preview must not make network requests. Zero API calls are enforced.
- Allows installing third-party npm packages via `package.json` for compilation, dev servers, or graphics/visual rendering helpers.
- This preview expresses product visual and interaction intent based on `docs/mvp/MVP.md`.
- This preview is oriented toward end users and customer/business readers, not only internal wireframe review.
- Requires running and passing `node validate_preview.js` testing successfully before final sign-off.
